				\begin{document}$${\upvarepsilon } = \frac{{{\text{(V}}_{{1}} - {\text{V}}_{{2}} {)}}}{{{\text{(V}}_{{2}} - {\text{V}}_{{3}} {)}}}$$\end{document} Swelling test of scaffolds Initially, the cut scaffolds were weighed (W initial ) and then immersed in PBS phosphate buffer solution for 24 h for incubation. After incubation, the samples were removed from the buffer solution, and any excess water was blotted off with filter paper. The swelling test was repeated three times for each sample. The swelling ratio for each sample was calculated using the following equation 37 : 2 \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
